flowchart TD
 User[Browser] --> P1[Authenticate and route]
 P1 --> P2[Validate request]
 P2 --> P3[Execute application logic]
 P3 <--> D1[(User and content tables)]
 P3 --> P4[Store optional image]
 P4 <--> D2[(Public filesystem)]
 P3 --> P5[Create Inertia response]
 P5 --> User
 P3 --> P6[Send notification email when configured]
 P6 --> Mail[Mail transport]
